			<entry>
				
					<id>14441634999</id>
				
					<title>HKID capturing doesn’t work with iPhone16 Pro (and other models)</title>
				
					<content type="text">The capture uses only bottom lens (Main camera) which is incapable to focus on close object. 

Tested on iPhone 13 works fine.</content>
				
					<im:contentType term="Application" label="應用程式"/>
				
					<im:voteSum>0</im:voteSum>
				
					<im:voteCount>0</im:voteCount>
				
					<im:rating>1</im:rating>
				
					<updated>2026-08-17T23:11:41-07:00</updated>
				
					<im:version>3.73.5</im:version>
				
					<author><name>Raymondhokazuki</name><uri>https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id551414342</uri></author>
				
					<link rel="related" href="https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=1164066737&amp;type=Purple%20Software"/>
				
				
					<content type="html">&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;
            &lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
                &lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;
                    
                    
                    	&lt;td width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;
                    
                        &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apps.apple.com/hk/app/hsbc-hk-mobile-banking/id1164066737?uo=2&quot;&gt;HKID capturing doesn’t work with iPhone16 Pro (and other models)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
                        
                        
                        
                        

                        

                       &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica,Arial,Geneva,Swiss,SunSans-Regular&quot;&gt;
						
                        &lt;/font&gt;
                    &lt;/td&gt;
                &lt;/tr&gt;
            &lt;/table&gt;
        &lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;
            
                &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica,Arial,Geneva,Swiss,SunSans-Regular&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The capture uses only bottom lens (Main camera) which is incapable to focus on close object. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Tested on iPhone 13 works fine.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
            
            
            
