			<entry>
				
					<id>14243637313</id>
				
					<title>Unable to view transactions.</title>
				
					<content type="text">Unable to view transactions on mobile App or website. If you made a transfer but forgot to take a screenshot or share the image, you could never recover the details. I am switching to Citibank for all my money transfers from now on.</content>
				
